    "Stackmap planning spans 12.49\u201316.90% across all four targets. This proves a substantial owner, not that all analyses inside it are duplicate.",
    "No sum includes both backend_call and its children or function_emit and its setup child. Disjoint body is inclusive function_emit minus setup; backend residual is separately bounded.",
    "Final section/metadata work in backend_finalize is outside body. optimize=False skips the AArch64 CFG peepholes in this CI route. Linux x86 packed stackmaps defer metadata to assembler; Windows finalizer still renders symbolic metadata, so finalization work moves across boundaries."
